  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maternal Health in Luanda - MLP Centralsjukhuset</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xf6;drav&#xe5;rd i Luanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xf6;drav&#xe5;rdsprogrammet i Luanda &#xe4;r uppdelat p&#xe5; 4 komponenter: 1) DPSL (provinsen).Delegacao Provincial de Saude em Luanda, Kostn.f arvoden och reemb har lagts p&#xe5; komp 04 2) MLP (Centralsjukhuset) 3) Faculdade de Medicina 4) Caol (samordningsorgan) Genomf&#xf6;randekonsult &#xe4;r InDevelop.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The maternal health programme in Luanda is divided in 4 components 1) DPSL(Delegacao Provincial de Saude de Luanda). Costs for fees and reembursables charged in comp 04 2) MLP (the Central Hospital) 3) Faculdade de Medicina 4) CAOL (coordinator) Implementing agency is InDevelop</narrative>
  </description>
